{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"271"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログのコメントがたくさん増えても、ある程度はファンとの交流を計ってくれるかなー？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっちろん(ω)♪\nだからみなさんこれからも遊びに来てくださいよー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"272"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日芽香さんってボケとツッコミどっちですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大抵ぼけ(ω)\nでもひめたん以上にボケる人といるとツッコミにかわります♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"273"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんお正月は着物着たりするの？（今年は東京だからないかな？）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島におっても着物は着んかなー。\n去年の夏祭りの時は着ましたきました(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"274"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーと初詣に行くのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー未定('・・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元に帰ってから初詣いきたいんぢゃけど、まだやっとるかなー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その頃には終わっとる気がする...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"275"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おみくじ何でしたか？ひめたん萌吉とか出そうやし(^_^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"も、も、もえきちー!!!\n(*/ω＼*)\n萌吉のおみくじ引きたいっ!\nでもひめたん実際、去年末吉引いたんよ...。\nぢゃけ怖くて引けない('・・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"276"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、日芽香ちゃんは初詣には行かれましたかー？？\n277"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初詣は3日までに行けばOKだった気がする(｀・∀・´)\n278"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日中に行ければセーフだね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは行けなかった('・ω・`)\n代わりに昨日家族みんなで行ってくれたみたいです♪\nそして代わりにおみくじ引いてくれたんと。\nひめたんの今年の運勢はー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どぅるどぅるどぅるどぅるーじゃじゃじゃん!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大吉!!!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/images/2012/01/24/himeka0043.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃなくて\nひめたん小吉。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(`・ω・')"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"279"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初夢何か見ましたか～？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー覚えてない('・ω・`)\nしかもその日年賀状書いとってあんま寝とらん...\nうー来年こそは富士・鷹・なすび!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"280"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お正月といえばお年玉、ひめたんはもらったのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぱぱままの分は送ってもらったです♪\n親戚のみなさんには今年ご挨拶できんかった('・ω・`)←\nお年玉とかいらんけ会いたい!\n親戚のクッキーちゃんってヨーキーにも会いたーい!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"281"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんもお餅食べたかな？\nひめたんはなに餅が好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お雑煮のお餅を２分の１こ食べた(・∀・)\nいつもはもっぱらきなこ餅派!ひめたんいっつも焼く係よーお♪\n電子レンジだって美味しく焼けるんぢゃけ。うん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"282"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今気がついたんだけど、中元日芽香という名前に「元日」が入っているね☆\nすごく縁起のいい名前だね(^O^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中元日芽香...ほんまぢゃー!\n15年と8ヶ月半生きてて、始めて自分の名前の縁起の良さに気づいた瞬間。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"283"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お買い物に行って福袋を買ったのかな？\nお気に入りの洋服とかは入っていましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福袋買いましたよ(^^)\nひなぴょん(川後陽菜chan)とおんなじ福袋かったら、中身がまったくおんなじだったー\nおそろいってことですね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"284"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんを妹にしたいのですが、いいですか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん(ω)♪\nいや、ひめたんの中ではすでにお兄さんお姉さんとお話ししとるつもりーふふふ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"285"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シングルイベントで個別があるけど、ひめたんに何回も行くと迷惑ですか？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全然まったく!むしろ嬉しいーいいぃ♪♪\n何回も来てきてー!待ってますよー＼^^／\n楽しいお話いっぱいしたいな!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"286"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日どんなことやるんやろ　ひめたんどんなことやったか教えてね\n287"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また夜にでも今日のレポお願いしま～す!(b^ー°)\n288"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"blogでレポート待っとるばい！\n289"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イベント終わったらちょっとでいいからネタ晴らしよろしくね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は何をしたかというとね\nお餅つきをさせていただきー、\nおしるこをみなさんに振る舞わさせていただきー、\n新年の抱負を発表させていただきましたー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"続きはこっちで読んでね↓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん(* ゝω・*)ノその50"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"290"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島弁で、さよならや、バイバイって、どう言いますか？\n生駒さんの、へばなっ！が、気になります。\n広島弁で、インパクトのある挨拶を教えてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいばいー...\n広島の挨拶はわりと普通かな。\nそう!メンバーのみんなと気づいたのよー!\n広島とか大阪とか九州は語尾が方言になったりするんぢゃけど、\n北海道とか秋田とかは名詞が方言ってゆー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！ばいばいーの他に...ほいじゃーとかほいじゃーねーとか言う人もいる。わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"291"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ショッピングはどちらに行かれたんですか＾＾？\n渋谷？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"池袋・渋谷・原宿!\n今どきのおんなのこが集まる場所を制覇してまいりました(ω)★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"292"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"四季の中では何が一番好き？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はる(*^^*)\n春は出会いの季節っていうし\nあったかいからお昼寝するのにちょうどいいし\nひめたんのお誕生日が待っとるし♪\n今年の春は特に節目になりそうだし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"293"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは乃木坂メンバーのblogは見てる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぱそこんが手元にある時は全員分みます♪\nひめたんの携帯だとフィルタリングかかっとってブログにアクセスできん('・ω・`)ちーん\n乃木坂キャラ濃ゆいですよね。文章見ただけで誰が書いたかわかるもんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"294"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めざましテレビ観てたら乃木坂の新しいCM流れてたよ～\n「乃木坂46、始動」ちなみに、7時25分ごろだった観るしか！w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"報告ありがとうございます(`・・)ゞ\n乃木メン誰もそのＣＭ見とらんかったー!\nみるしか!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"295"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂コールって、メンバーが考えたのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そですよ♪\nメンバー全員でちょっとずつ案出し合って決めましたよー(ω)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"296"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホームシックに、なっていませんか？\n寂しくなったら、声に出してくださいね。\nブログで叫んでもいいからさ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰りたーい(>_<)!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"297"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『チャラ字』=『汚い字』って意味なんだけど広島では通じる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へーえ初知り!\n広島人には通じない多分。\n方言とは違うんでしょうねおそらくね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"298"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うちのショップにも乃木坂のPOPと予約券が並んでるよ！\n緊張？ワクワク？\nどんな心境なんかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんびりーばぼー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"299"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂のレッスンってどれくらいの頻度であるの？毎日？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいにち(`・・)ゞ\nんでもひめたんは、平日は広島なので参加できません。\n東京組がうらやましいー。ひめたんも上京してはよレッスン参加したい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"300"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オタフクは有名だけど牡蠣醤油はとう？\nやっぱりたくさん使うの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"牡蠣醤油使ってみたい!\nひめたん家にはないです。食べたことないー。\nでも今まあや(和田まあやchan)に聞いたら、\n和田家の食卓には常備してあるんだって(ω)♪\nえ？中元家だけ？"}],"source":"archive"}